  "details": "In the Android version of the app, you can send a friend request when searching for someone in the phone app interface (before hitting “Play” to go into full VRchat). This is super useful at cons etc, for friending people you meet in person quickly. \n\nSimilarly, there’s unfriend/cancel friend request/etc options within the app interface on Android.\n\nThis functionality doesn’t appear to be present in the iOS beta yet but I’d love to see it in a future build!",
